Subject: [PATCH] FreqAI Memory Optimization and Training Improvements

## Changes

### 1. FreqAI Memory Management (freqai_interface.py)
- Added automatic memory cleanup after each model training
- Implemented gc.collect() and malloc_trim() to prevent memory fragmentation
- Added debug logging for training progress monitoring
- Prevents "malloc(): corrupted top size" crashes during long training sessions

### 2. Exchange Proxy Compatibility (exchange.py)
- Fixed async API calls to use sync API for proxy compatibility
- Improved market loading with better error handling
- Added logging for leverage tiers loading progress

### 3. Type Safety Fix (trade_model.py)
- Fixed stop_loss_pct type conversion to ensure float type

## Benefits
- Stable training for large number of coins
- Memory usage stays stable during continuous model training
- Better visibility into training progress via logs

